OL,3,GNEWSAFamily builds Ganesha statue out
OL,4,Aof 4,500 Tic Tacs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family has celebrated the Hindu
OL,7,Ffestival of Ganesh Chaturthi in a
OL,8,Funique way by building a statue of Lord
OL,9,FGanesha out of Tic Tacs.
OL,11,FThe statue's body is made of clay and
OL,12,Fapproximately 4,500 of the miniature
OL,13,Fmints, all of which were individually
OL,14,Fstuck on by hand.
OL,16,FGanesh Chaturthi is a 10-day festival
OL,17,Fthat celebrates the birth of Lord
OL,18,FGanesha, the elephant-headed god of
OL,19,Fwisdom.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
