OL,3,GNEWSAFamily builds Ganesha statue out
OL,4,Aof 4,500 Tic Tacs
OL,5,
OL,6,FBhavini Shah, her husband Chetan and
OL,7,Ffamily friends spent more than 132
OL,8,Fhours between them piecing the statue
OL,9,Ftogether as part of their celebrations
OL,10,Fin Hucknall, Nottinghamshire.
